    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Nursing Council of Kenya is urging nurses and midwives to build partnerships that will contribute to the overall improvement of health services in Kenya. The council says applying concerted effort will also propel nurses into leadership roles as the country gears up to offering universal health coverage.",
